## Interface: 30300
## Title: Uncapped UI
## Notes: Modular, theme-aware UI toolkit shared by Uncapped addons.
## Author: Uncapped
## Version: 0.0.0
## SavedVariables: UncappedUIDB

UncappedNative.lua
# [#1008] Re-routes a leading-dot command onto a whisper-to-self while the player is
# a ghost, because the 3.3.5a client refuses to SEND a SAY while dead and SAY is what
# carries every dot-command on this realm. Loaded early and deliberately depends on
# nothing in this addon -- it only hooks SendChatMessage, and `.dropcombat` being
# reachable while dead should not rest on the UI toolkit having initialised.
UncappedCommand.lua
UncappedUI.lua
# Right after the namespace bootstrap: every other file may register a frame
# with it, and CreateWindow does so for free.
